---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="页面不存在" description="你要找的内容不存在，或已经移动到了别处。">
  <section class="home-empty shell" aria-labelledby="not-found-title">
    <span>ERROR 404</span>
    <h1 id="not-found-title">这个坐标，地图上找不到。</h1>
    <p>链接可能失效，内容可能被整理到了别处。回到首页，或者从归档里重新出发。</p>
    <div class="not-found-actions">
      <a class="hero-link" href="/">回到首页 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="text-link" href="/archive/">打开归档 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
